      "mergedPostDetails": "When you're typing in VR it can occasionally respawn you, or make you recalibrate if you're in FBT when you press on some letters. I'm not sure how to exactly reproduce it, but it happens much more often in FBT and when your keyboard is a little bit down, super annoying. And when it makes you go in calibration state you can't type anymore, until you close keyboard, and finish calibration.",
