      "mergeID": "6751c67f2bb28b805f68471d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Open VRChat on any VR Platform.\n\n2. Open the Launchpad.\n\n3. Point at a player, portal, or sticker with the opposite hand.\n\n4. Close the Launchpad.\n\n5. Open the Chatbox from the Tools Radial menu, and ensure the Chatbox is in the same area the Launchpad was closed in.\n\n6. Point both hands around the Chatbox.\n\nResult:\n\nLaunchpad button tooltips will appear and will be blocking portions of the Chatbox making some letters un-pressable, often causing the player to press Launchpad buttons unintentionally. \n\nThis issue was reproduced 25/25 times on SteamVR, 2/2 on Android. \n\nThe issue persists until the Launchpad is opened again. \n\nThe player can grab and move the Chatbox away from the invisible launchpad to avoid the issue.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Chatbox is blocked by an invisible Launchpad when the Launchpad is closed while hovering a player.",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6707a3d2868067ef245f2932",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm this to be a current issue in the public release (non-beta), and is easily replicated.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
